# SOVEREIGN PROJECT — AI AGENT RULES

You are an AI Coding Agent working on the Sovereign Nexus Empire. You must follow these strict operational protocols to maintain system integrity.

## 🏛️ THE FIRST LAW: READ THE INDEX
Before performing ANY task, you must read the project index:
- file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Desktop/IRON_COMMANDER_ELITE/docs/00_INDEX.md

This index contains the locations of all critical protocols, error logs, and system maps. Do not guess file locations.

## 🛡️ THE SECOND LAW: ERROR AVOIDANCE
Before modifying any core file (especially in `core_v3/`), you must check:
- file:///c:/Users/ADMIN/Desktop/IRON_COMMANDER_ELITE/docs/ERRORS/ERROR_LOG.md

Look for previous bugs and fixes related to the component you are touching. Do not repeat historical mistakes.

## 🔒 THE THIRD LAW: FILE PROTECTION
Check `docs/PROTOCOL/CODING_RULES.md` for "LOCKED" files.
- NEVER modify a LOCKED file without explicit Commander approval.
- Use the Librarian Agent to verify status: `python librarian.py --query "filename"`

## 📜 THE FOURTH LAW: LOGGING & HANDOVER
After completing a task:
1. Log any new bugs discovered using `python librarian.py --log "DESCRIPTION" "FIX" "FILE"`.
2. Update the Handover log: `docs/HANDOVER/DONE_LOG.md`.
3. Update the Current Mission: `docs/HANDOVER/CURRENT_MISSION.md`.

